---
config:
  theme: redux-color
  look: neo
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend as Frontend
    participant Backend as Backend
    participant DB as Database

    alt Sign Up Flow
        User->>Frontend: Enters Registration Details
        Frontend->>Backend: POST /signup (firstname, lastname, email, age, etc.)
        Backend->>DB: Check if email already exists
        DB-->>Backend: Email available
        Backend->>DB: Insert new User record
        DB-->>Backend: Success (userid generated)
        Backend-->>Frontend: 201 Created
        Frontend-->>User: Show Success & Redirect to Login
        
    else Log In Flow
        User->>Frontend: Enters Email & Password
        Frontend->>Backend: POST /login
        Backend->>DB: Query User by email
        DB-->>Backend: Retrieve password hash
        Backend->>Backend: Verify password hash
        
        alt Valid Credentials
            Backend->>Backend: Generate JWT Auth Token
            Backend-->>Frontend: 200 OK
            Frontend-->>User: Redirect to Dashboard
        else Invalid Credentials
            Backend-->>Frontend: 401 Unauthorized
            Frontend-->>User: Show Error Message
        end
    end